<title>HONG KONG: Franklin ups stake in Guangzhou Shipyard.</title>
<headline>Franklin ups stake in Guangzhou Shipyard.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Franklin Resources Inc told the stock exchange on Friday it had raised its holding in Chinese ship builder Guangzhou Shipyard International Co Ltd by 8.59 million shares, or 3.05 percent of its H-share capital.</p>
<p>Franklin gave no details on its shareholding in the company. Shares of Guangzhou Shipyard were untraded at HK$1.78 each in early Friday morning.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
